x86_64-linux  clang zeroes the empty `List<...>` and `Seq<...>` temporaries passed by value with a call to memset where cxx1 writes nothing for a class with no members - the difference S-09 recorded in CLAUDE.md, a question about emission and not about a name; the other 18 names, the `JXspT_EE` expansions among them, agree.
x86_64-windows  the same memset; every other name agrees. arm64-darwin agrees on all 18.
